# MXFP8 matmul harness (MX block scales).
#
# --dt=<a>:<b>:<c> -- a = src, b = weights, c = dst. One triple per run.
# src/wei always use static MX block scales (user-provided): e8m0,
# per_tensor mask, group 1x32 (src) and 32x1 (wei).
# dst is either f32 (no dst scales) or f8_e4m3/f8_e5m2 with optional dynamic
# mx dst scales (computed by the library): e8m0, group 1x32.
# Note: `mx` (dynamic_mx) is valid on dst only; src/wei scales are inputs.
#
# Tags are left as `any`: the shape set mixes 2D, 3D and 4D cases.
# Shapes come from shapes_dynamic_mx_plain_small (K % 32 == 0, N % 32 == 0;
# M, K, N <= 512; 3D batch <= 16; 4D total batch <= 32).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# f32 destination, no dst scales, no post-ops.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--reset
--skip-impl=ref
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:f32
--stag=any --wtag=any --dtag=any
--attr-scales=src:per_tensor:e8m0:1x32+wei:per_tensor:e8m0:32x1
--attr-post-ops=
--batch=shapes_dynamic_mx_plain_small

--reset
--skip-impl=ref
--dt=f8_e5m2:f8_e5m2:f32
--stag=any --wtag=any --dtag=any
--attr-scales=src:per_tensor:e8m0:1x32+wei:per_tensor:e8m0:32x1
--attr-post-ops=
--batch=shapes_dynamic_mx_plain_small

